 "title": "Naomi Nakano-Matsumoto",
 "intro": "Report an officeholder change\nNaomi Nakano-Matsumoto is an at-large member of the Fremont Union High Board of Education in California. She assumed office in 2018. Her current term ends on December 11, 2026.\nNakano-Matsumoto is running for re-election to the Fremont Union High School District Board of Education district 4 in California. She is on the ballot in the general election on November 3, 2026.",
